---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/Footer.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<Default />
<div class="site-notice">
  <p>
    This is Jeff Hong's personal technical portfolio. It is not an official account of Taiwan Auto-Design Co. (TADC).
    Ansys is a trademark of Ansys, Inc.; this portfolio is not officially affiliated with Ansys, Inc.
  </p>
  <p class="zh">
    本網站為洪敬傑（Jeff Hong）的個人技術作品集，並非虎門科技股份有限公司（TADC）官方帳號。Ansys 為 Ansys, Inc.
    的商標；本作品集與 Ansys, Inc. 無官方隸屬關係。
  </p>
  <p>
    © 2026 Jeff Hong. Demonstration only — all rights reserved. Nothing on this site grants a licence to use, copy or
    redistribute the tools or their content. Commercial licensing and support:{" "}
    <a href={site.companyUrl}>{site.companyEn}</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="zh">僅供展示，保留所有權利；本網站不授予任何工具或內容的使用、複製或散布權。商用授權與技術支援請洽虎門科技（TADC）。</p>
</div>

<style>
  .site-notice {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .site-notice p {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
